      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really don't want to go back to the doctor right now if i can help it lol. it's just for mood stuff. like, is it actually a big deal? i mean it's just an herb, it's not like a heavy prescription med. i just want to know if it's safe to start taking it today or if i should be really worried about the pill not working.",
